|-----|-----|------- |----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  0  |   x |      x |      x         | nothing                                                            |
|  1  |   x |      x | B1/Bi/T1/Ti    | untracked/ignored blob/tree (SAFE)                                 |
